["<aside class=\"callout why\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Why it matters</div><p>Five controls run the whole SKS (Simonov self loading carbine). Know them blind and you never fumble with a loaded rifle.</p></aside><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Close up of the SKS action, right side, with 5 numbered controls in orange: 1 safety behind the trigger, 2 operating handle, 3 magazine catch in front of the trigger guard, 4 top cover pin at the rear of the receiver, 5 gas tube lock lever at the rear sight.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26.0\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The 5 controls</text>\n<polygon points=\"-246.5,142.0 -246.5,265.5 -189.5,246.5 -23.2,187.6 38.5,162.9 209.5,159.1 323.5,149.6 475.5,136.3 481.2,124.9 475.5,115.4 226.6,115.4 226.6,118.2 29.0,118.2 19.5,124.9 -18.5,129.7\" fill=\"#A8743F\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-242.7\" y=\"187.6\" width=\"20.9\" height=\"24.7\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#8C5E33\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><polygon points=\"138.2,159.1 138.2,176.2 209.5,180.0 217.1,170.5 215.2,159.1\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"131.6,161.0 137.3,161.0 135.4,178.1 130.6,178.1\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M67.0 161.0 L69.8 185.7 L125.9 185.7 L129.7 161.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"5.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M103.1 161.0 Q97.4 170.5 101.2 180.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"4.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"81.2\" y1=\"163.8\" x2=\"95.5\" y2=\"171.4\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"5.699999999999999\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"81.2\" cy=\"163.8\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"27.1,118.2 27.1,92.6 36.6,86.9 228.5,86.9 228.5,118.2\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M34.7 86.9 L38.5 78.3 Q133.5 74.5 228.5 78.3 L228.5 86.9 Z\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"36.6\" y1=\"98.3\" x2=\"44.2\" y2=\"113.5\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"36.6\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"3.8\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"94.5\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"102.1\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"3.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"200.0\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"8.5\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"226.6\" y=\"81.2\" width=\"58.9\" height=\"30.4\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"232.3,81.2 281.7,72.7 283.6,81.2\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"226.6\" y=\"97.3\" width=\"495.9\" height=\"13.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"285.5\" y=\"83.1\" width=\"228.0\" height=\"12.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"287.4\" y=\"78.3\" width=\"186.2\" height=\"18.1\" rx=\"2.8499999999999996\" fill=\"#A8743F\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"281.7\" y1=\"92.6\" x2=\"274.1\" y2=\"105.9\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"281.7\" cy=\"92.6\" r=\"3.3\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"508.8,81.2 546.8,81.2 546.8,112.5 513.5,112.5\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"485.0\" y1=\"124.0\" x2=\"695.9\" y2=\"124.0\" stroke=\"#8E9690\" stroke-width=\"2.8499999999999996\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"695.9\" cy=\"124.0\" r=\"3.3\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"418.5,116.3 663.6,114.5 663.6,120.2 418.5,118.2\" fill=\"#AEB4AE\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"657.9\" y=\"110.7\" width=\"20.9\" height=\"13.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"679.8\" y=\"94.5\" width=\"25.6\" height=\"17.1\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"689.2\" y=\"75.5\" width=\"6.6\" height=\"19.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M684.5 92.6 Q690.1 64.1 692.1 64.1 Q694.1 64.1 700.6 92.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><g data-tip=\"Safety|Forward and up: safe, it blocks the trigger. Rearward and down: fire.\"><line x1=\"87.9\" y1=\"168.6\" x2=\"90.0\" y2=\"268.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"87.9\" cy=\"168.6\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"90.0\" cy=\"268.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90.0\" y=\"273.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text></g><g data-tip=\"Operating handle|Pull fully back and let go. Bolt stays open on an empty magazine.\"><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"98.3\" x2=\"250.0\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"200.0\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"250.0\" cy=\"60.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"250.0\" y=\"65.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text></g><g data-tip=\"Magazine catch|Pull back: the magazine swings open and the rounds drop out.\"><line x1=\"133.5\" y1=\"174.3\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"268.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"133.5\" cy=\"174.3\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"200.0\" cy=\"268.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"273.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text></g><g data-tip=\"Cover pin|Turn it up and pull it right to free the top cover.\"><line x1=\"36.6\" y1=\"98.3\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"36.6\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"40.0\" cy=\"60.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"65.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text></g><g data-tip=\"Gas tube lock|Turn it up to free the gas tube. Down to lock it.\"><line x1=\"277.9\" y1=\"98.3\" x2=\"340.0\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"277.9\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#17201A\"/><circle cx=\"340.0\" cy=\"60.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"340.0\" y=\"65.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text></g>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Tap each number: safety, handle, magazine catch, cover pin, gas tube lock.</li><li>Point in a safe direction, finger off the trigger, check it is unloaded before you touch any of them.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the controls in the manual's words</summary><ul><li><strong>Safety (1):</strong> \"apply the safety by rotating it forward and upward\"; to fire, \"rotate the safety rearward until it is parallel to the trigger\" (95%, US Army TC 9-56, 1969).</li><li><strong>Operating handle (2):</strong> \"Grasp the operating handle, pull it fully to the rear, and release it. If the magazine is empty, the bolt will remain open\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li><strong>Magazine catch (3):</strong> \"pull back the magazine catch and allow the magazine to swing open\" <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li><strong>Cover pin (4):</strong> rotate it to vertical and pull it out to free the top cover <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Chapter 6.</li><li><strong>Gas tube lock (5):</strong> rotate it up to free the gas tube; down to lock <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Chapter 6.</li><li>Part names come from <a href=\"#/s/mc-sks-01/2\">Know the parts</a> in chapter 1.</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The SKS safety lever, in orange, behind the trigger. Left, SAFE: lever turned forward and up, it blocks the trigger. Right, FIRE: lever turned rearward and down against the rear of the trigger guard.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26.0\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The safety: two positions</text>\n<text x=\"100.0\" y=\"56.0\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#2E7D4F\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SAFE</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"56.0\" font-size=\"17\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#B3261E\" text-anchor=\"middle\">FIRE</text><rect x=\"28.0\" y=\"120.0\" width=\"150.0\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M58.0 144.0 L62.0 182.0 L138.0 182.0 L144.0 144.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"6.0\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M108.0 144.0 Q100.0 160.0 106.0 172.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"5.0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"76.0\" y1=\"148.0\" x2=\"94.0\" y2=\"160.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"6.0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"128.0\" y=\"94.0\" width=\"16.0\" height=\"28.0\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"228.0\" y=\"120.0\" width=\"150.0\" height=\"24.0\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M258.0 144.0 L262.0 182.0 L338.0 182.0 L344.0 144.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"6.0\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M308.0 144.0 Q300.0 160.0 306.0 172.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"5.0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"276.0\" y1=\"148.0\" x2=\"266.0\" y2=\"174.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"6.0\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"328.0\" y=\"94.0\" width=\"16.0\" height=\"28.0\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><path d=\"M79.0 172.5 A26 26 0 0 0 114.5 163.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"116.5,159.5 114.3,174.0 105.1,168.7\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"228.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Forward and up.</text><text x=\"100.0\" y=\"248.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Blocks the trigger.</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"228.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Rearward and down,</text><text x=\"300.0\" y=\"248.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">against the guard.</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"288.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">The safety is a part. Safe is a habit.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Forward and up: SAFE. It blocks the trigger <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Rearward and down, against the guard: FIRE <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: what the safety does and does not do</summary><ul><li>\"The safety, when rotated up to the safe position, places a block behind the trigger and prevents the trigger from being pressed\" (95%, TC 9-56).</li><li>It blocks the trigger. The manual does not say it locks the hammer or the firing pin (95%, my reading). A hard knock or a stuck pin can still fire a loaded rifle (Tip).</li><li>The safety must be on before the trigger group catch can be pressed <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>. Chapter 6.</li><li>Every manual says the same in its own words: a safety is a mechanical part, never a substitute for safe handling (95%, see <a href=\"#/s/rifle-mechanics/0\">how a rifle works</a>).</li></ul><aside class=\"callout warn\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Warning</div><p>Three rifles, three safeties. Tikka: safety off to work the bolt. CZ 457: bolt opens with safety on. SKS: lever behind the trigger, forward is safe. Say it out loud when you switch.</p></aside></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Close up of the action. The operating handle, in orange, is pulled fully back and the bolt is held open over an empty magazine. Arrow shows the handle moving back.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26.0\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bolt hold open</text>\n<polygon points=\"-246.5,142.0 -246.5,265.5 -189.5,246.5 -23.2,187.6 38.5,162.9 209.5,159.1 323.5,149.6 475.5,136.3 481.2,124.9 475.5,115.4 226.6,115.4 226.6,118.2 29.0,118.2 19.5,124.9 -18.5,129.7\" fill=\"#A8743F\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-242.7\" y=\"187.6\" width=\"20.9\" height=\"24.7\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#8C5E33\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><polygon points=\"138.2,159.1 138.2,176.2 209.5,180.0 217.1,170.5 215.2,159.1\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"131.6,161.0 137.3,161.0 135.4,178.1 130.6,178.1\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M67.0 161.0 L69.8 185.7 L125.9 185.7 L129.7 161.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"5.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M103.1 161.0 Q97.4 170.5 101.2 180.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"4.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"81.2\" y1=\"163.8\" x2=\"95.5\" y2=\"171.4\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"5.699999999999999\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"81.2\" cy=\"163.8\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"27.1,118.2 27.1,92.6 36.6,86.9 228.5,86.9 228.5,118.2\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"152.5\" y=\"88.8\" width=\"66.5\" height=\"13.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#2A2F2B\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M34.7 86.9 L38.5 78.3 Q133.5 74.5 228.5 78.3 L228.5 86.9 Z\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"36.6\" y1=\"98.3\" x2=\"44.2\" y2=\"113.5\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"4.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"36.6\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"3.8\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"133.5\" y1=\"94.5\" x2=\"133.5\" y2=\"102.1\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"3.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"133.5\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"8.5\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"226.6\" y=\"81.2\" width=\"58.9\" height=\"30.4\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"232.3,81.2 281.7,72.7 283.6,81.2\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"226.6\" y=\"97.3\" width=\"495.9\" height=\"13.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"285.5\" y=\"83.1\" width=\"228.0\" height=\"12.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"287.4\" y=\"78.3\" width=\"186.2\" height=\"18.1\" rx=\"2.8499999999999996\" fill=\"#A8743F\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"281.7\" y1=\"92.6\" x2=\"274.1\" y2=\"105.9\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"4.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"281.7\" cy=\"92.6\" r=\"3.3\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"508.8,81.2 546.8,81.2 546.8,112.5 513.5,112.5\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"485.0\" y1=\"124.0\" x2=\"695.9\" y2=\"124.0\" stroke=\"#8E9690\" stroke-width=\"2.8499999999999996\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"695.9\" cy=\"124.0\" r=\"3.3\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"418.5,116.3 663.6,114.5 663.6,120.2 418.5,118.2\" fill=\"#AEB4AE\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"657.9\" y=\"110.7\" width=\"20.9\" height=\"13.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"679.8\" y=\"94.5\" width=\"25.6\" height=\"17.1\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"689.2\" y=\"75.5\" width=\"6.6\" height=\"19.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M684.5 92.6 Q690.1 64.1 692.1 64.1 Q694.1 64.1 700.6 92.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"66.0\" x2=\"144.2\" y2=\"66.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"138.2,66.0 149.1,60.8 149.1,71.2\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"228.0\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pull fully back, let go.</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"250.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Empty magazine: the bolt stays open.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Empty magazine: the bolt stays open after the last shot <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Open bolt is a quick visual check, not proof. Look in the chamber (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: how the hold open works</summary><ul><li>\"When the last round is fed from the magazine, a nib on the magazine platform contacts the catch and forces it upward.\" The catch then holds the bolt open (95%, TC 9-56).</li><li>To close an empty rifle: open the magazine and pull the handle back and let go, or press the follower down slightly and do the same <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Ride the handle forward only when unloaded and pointing safe. Live rounds: let the bolt slam home by itself so it locks fully (Tip).</li></ul></details>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Close up of the action with the magazine catch pulled back and the magazine swung open, both in orange. Rounds drop out, so hold a hand or soft bag under it.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<polygon points=\"-246.5,142.0 -246.5,265.5 -189.5,246.5 -23.2,187.6 38.5,162.9 209.5,159.1 323.5,149.6 475.5,136.3 481.2,124.9 475.5,115.4 226.6,115.4 226.6,118.2 29.0,118.2 19.5,124.9 -18.5,129.7\" fill=\"#A8743F\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"-242.7\" y=\"187.6\" width=\"20.9\" height=\"24.7\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#8C5E33\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><polygon points=\"148.9,200.2 158.0,214.7 220.4,180.1 221.8,168.0 214.2,159.4\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"131.6,161.0 137.3,161.0 135.4,178.1 130.6,178.1\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M67.0 161.0 L69.8 185.7 L125.9 185.7 L129.7 161.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"5.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M103.1 161.0 Q97.4 170.5 101.2 180.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"4.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><line x1=\"81.2\" y1=\"163.8\" x2=\"95.5\" y2=\"171.4\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"5.699999999999999\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"81.2\" cy=\"163.8\" r=\"2.8\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"27.1,118.2 27.1,92.6 36.6,86.9 228.5,86.9 228.5,118.2\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M34.7 86.9 L38.5 78.3 Q133.5 74.5 228.5 78.3 L228.5 86.9 Z\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"36.6\" y1=\"98.3\" x2=\"44.2\" y2=\"113.5\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"4.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"36.6\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"3.8\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"200.0\" y1=\"94.5\" x2=\"200.0\" y2=\"102.1\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"3.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"200.0\" cy=\"98.3\" r=\"8.5\" fill=\"#C8CCC6\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"226.6\" y=\"81.2\" width=\"58.9\" height=\"30.4\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"232.3,81.2 281.7,72.7 283.6,81.2\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"226.6\" y=\"97.3\" width=\"495.9\" height=\"13.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"285.5\" y=\"83.1\" width=\"228.0\" height=\"12.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"287.4\" y=\"78.3\" width=\"186.2\" height=\"18.1\" rx=\"2.8499999999999996\" fill=\"#A8743F\" stroke=\"#6E4A2A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"281.7\" y1=\"92.6\" x2=\"274.1\" y2=\"105.9\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"4.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"281.7\" cy=\"92.6\" r=\"3.3\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"508.8,81.2 546.8,81.2 546.8,112.5 513.5,112.5\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"485.0\" y1=\"124.0\" x2=\"695.9\" y2=\"124.0\" stroke=\"#8E9690\" stroke-width=\"2.8499999999999996\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"695.9\" cy=\"124.0\" r=\"3.3\" fill=\"#8E9690\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"418.5,116.3 663.6,114.5 663.6,120.2 418.5,118.2\" fill=\"#AEB4AE\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"657.9\" y=\"110.7\" width=\"20.9\" height=\"13.3\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"679.8\" y=\"94.5\" width=\"25.6\" height=\"17.1\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#59625C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"689.2\" y=\"75.5\" width=\"6.6\" height=\"19.0\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#3A403C\" stroke=\"#17201A\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><path d=\"M684.5 92.6 Q690.1 64.1 692.1 64.1 Q694.1 64.1 700.6 92.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A403C\" stroke-width=\"2.8\"/><line x1=\"135.4\" y1=\"199.0\" x2=\"120.5\" y2=\"199.0\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"114.5,199.0 125.3,193.8 125.3,204.2\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FF6A13\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"40.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pull the catch back: the magazine</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"58.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">swings open and rounds drop out.</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"272.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hand or a soft bag under it.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Pull the catch back. The magazine swings open <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li><li>Every round in it drops out. Have a hand or bag under it (Tip).</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: why this is the SKS unload</summary><ul><li>The fixed magazine is part of the rifle. It is not removed; it swings open to empty (99%, RCMP FRT: \"fixed magazine with swing-down body assembly\").</li><li>Opening it does NOT empty the chamber. That needs the operating handle too (95%, TC 9-56 unloading steps). <a href=\"#/s/mc-sks-03\">Chapter 3</a> has the full unload.</li></ul></details>","<p>Point in a safe direction. Finger off the trigger. Unloaded and proved.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 400 300\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Function check in 6 steps: 1 unloaded, muzzle safe. 2 operating handle back and hold it. 3 press the magazine follower down. 4 let the bolt go forward. 5 safety on, press the trigger: the hammer must not fall. 6 safety off, press the trigger: the hammer falls.\">\n<rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#EEF1EA\"/>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"26.0\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Function check after every rebuild</text>\n<circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"52.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"57.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"57.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Unloaded. Muzzle safe.</text><circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"80.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"85.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"85.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Handle back and hold it.</text><circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"108.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Press the follower down.</text><circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"136.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#1F3D2B\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"141.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"141.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Let the bolt go forward.</text><circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"164.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"169.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"169.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Safety ON. Press trigger:</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"197.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"start\">hammer must NOT fall.</text><circle cx=\"36.0\" cy=\"220.0\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"36.0\" y=\"225.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"225.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"start\">Safety OFF. Press trigger:</text><text x=\"56.0\" y=\"253.0\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#FF6A13\" text-anchor=\"start\">hammer falls.</text>\n<text x=\"200.0\" y=\"288.0\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#17201A\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hammer falls on SAFE? Gunsmith.</text>\n</svg>\n</figure><ul><li>Do it after every rebuild and before every season (Tip).</li><li>Hammer falls with the safety on? Stop. Gunsmith <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>.</li></ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>More: the manual's function check</summary><ul><li>From the Type 56 training packet in TC 9-56 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span>:<ol><li>Pull the operating handle to the rear and hold it.</li><li>Press down on the magazine follower.</li><li>Allow the bolt to go forward.</li><li>Place the safety lever on SAFE.</li><li>Press the trigger: the hammer should not go forward.</li><li>Place the safety on FIRE.</li><li>Press the trigger: the hammer should go forward.</li></ol></li><li>Dry fire on an SKS strikes the free floating pin. Use a snap cap if you have one (Tip).</li><li>Extra check (Tip): after step 7, hold the trigger back, cycle the handle, ease off the trigger. You should feel a click as it resets, and the hammer must stay cocked.</li></ul></details>","<aside class=\"callout rule\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Grandpa's rule (wisdom, not law)</div><p>Grandpa's rule (wisdom): The safety is a part. Safe is a habit.</p></aside><aside class=\"callout mistake\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Common mistakes</div><ul><li>Thinking an open magazine means an empty rifle. The chamber can still hold a round.</li><li>Trusting the safety to stop a slam fire. It only blocks the trigger.</li><li>Mixing up the Tikka, CZ and SKS safety directions on the same trip.</li></ul></aside><aside class=\"callout field\" role=\"note\"><div class=\"callout-t\">Do this in the field</div><p>Unloaded, at home: 20 times, safety on and off without looking, then 5 function checks.</p></aside>","<ul><li>US Army, <a href=\"https://archive.org/download/gunmanual_sksmanual/sksmanual.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">TC 9-56 SKS Rifle, Simonov Type 56 (October 1969)</a>: operation, safety, bolt catch, function check, read directly 2026-10-23 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">95%</span></li><li>RCMP, <a href=\"https://rcmp.ca/en/firearms/firearms-reference-table\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Firearms Reference Table</a>, Type 56 SKS features, valid 19 October 2026 <span class=\"cert c-hi\" title=\"Certainty\">99%</span></li></ul>"]